OL,5,G1100 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FAction-packed highlights from the
OL,7,     Fdocumentary series following
OL,8,     FYorkshire-based law enforcers. Can
OL,9,     Fthe cops stop a nighttime riot
OL,10,     Ffrom breaking out in Bradford?
OL,11,G1200 Traffic Cops
OL,12,     FIn Bradford there's a high-octane
OL,13,     Fchase through a housing estate,
OL,14,     Fand Yorkshire's back roads have
OL,15,     Ftheir peace disturbed by two cars
OL,16,     Fcarrying gun-toting drug dealers.
OL,17,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,18,     FA driver nearly causes carnage to
OL,19,     Fmake sure his takeaway stays hot,
OL,20,     Fa large cannabis stash is found at
OL,21,     Fthe scene of a crash, and a drunk
OL,22,     Fdriver gets caught short.
