OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FEmma comes in complaining of
OL,7,     Fchronic pain in her spine and leg,
OL,8,     FColin has a sore scrotum and is
OL,9,     Fworried he's found a lump, and
OL,10,     Fgravedigger Neil's hernia is
OL,11,     Fcausing him discomfort.
OL,12,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FIt's all change at Barnsley
OL,14,     Fcasualty as a new system is
OL,15,     Fintroduced; Sister Benita takes on
OL,16,     Fthe role of team leader for the
OL,17,     Ffirst time; the staff treats
OL,18,     Fcritical patients.
