OL,5,G0100 Cold Case Killers
OL,6,     FAfter two young girls were killed,
OL,7,     Fa mishandled prosecution ended in
OL,8,     Fa murderer walking free until a
OL,9,     Flater, more dedicated
OL,10,     Finvestigation brought him to
OL,11,     Fjustice.
OL,12,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FA high call-out for ambulances has
OL,14,     Fresulted in paramedics queuing
OL,15,     Fwith patients in the corridor at
OL,16,     FBarnsley Casualty. The team must
OL,17,     Fdecide who is seen and who can
OL,18,     Fwait.
